data: {"id": "3fece6d57aa14b19-thinking-layer-343", "run_id": "3fece6d57aa14b19", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "该 Pod 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态，根据 runbook，我需要确认终止状态（Terminated Reason）是否为 `OOMKilled`。如果 `Last State` 不是 `OOMKilled`，则可能属于 `CrashLoopBackOffRuntime`（应用配置错误、进程退出、探针杀死等）或 `CreateContainerConfigError`。\n\n我将获取 `pod-crashloop-runtime.md` 以覆盖非 OOM 场景，并立即执行 `kubectl describe` 来获取该 Pod 的详细状态（重点关注 Last State 和 Events）。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788450554219}

