event: thinking
data: {"id": "3fece6d57aa14b19-thinking-parallel_evidence-1997", "run_id": "3fece6d57aa14b19", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我先执行计划中的 Kubernetes、Logs 和 Metrics 关键工具，同时基于已有的 Trace 和 Logs baseline 做后续补证。\n\n**第一轮执行计划：**\n1. `kubectl describe pod` - 确认终止原因、Exit Code、重启计数\n2. `kubectl get pod -o yaml` - 确认资源限制、探针配置\n3. `kubectl events` - 确认崩溃事件序列\n4. `kubectl previous logs` - 查看崩溃前日志\n5. `kubectl logs` - 查看当前日志\n6. `execute_pod_promql` (retries) - 重启计数和内存指标\n7. `query_pod_logs` - 基于已有日志线索，用 trace_id 和 memory keywords 精确查询\n8. `query_pod_tracing` - 基于已有 trace_id 进一步确认应用层行为\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788450633410, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

