inux OOM Killer 强制终止了进程，导致 Pod 反复重启并进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态。证据链完整（日志显示分配模式、Metric 显示逼近限制的峰值、K8s 显示 OOMKilled 结果），符合正式 RCA 描述。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 41.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 103.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h: 103.5s (Evidence 88.3s, RCA 15.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h**: pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 157.687, "metrics": {"run_id": "3fece6d57aa14b19", "mttr": {"value": "2.6m", "seconds": 157.69463109970093, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_